1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,390
Just after a quarter to one in the
morning on March the twenty-first,

2
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:10,310
2005, the US House of Representatives
passed a law about one woman.

3
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:13,070
Within the hour, the
President signed it.

4
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:18,000
It gave a federal court the power to
hear her parents' case again,

5
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:22,470
from the start. And it said it set no
precedent for anyone else.

6
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:26,680
Her name was Terri Schiavo.

7
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:31,210
Fifteen years earlier, when she was
twenty-six, her heart had stopped

8
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:32,340
at home in Florida.

9
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:37,520
Paramedics restarted it, but her brain
had gone too long without oxygen.

10
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:39,180
She never recovered.

11
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:43,320
She had left nothing in writing.

12
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:47,390
Her husband, Michael, said she had told
him she wouldn't want to live

13
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:52,720
like that. Her parents, Bob and Mary
Schindler, didn't believe it,

14
00:00:52,970 --> 00:00:54,920
and believed she was still aware.

15
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:59,030
A judge had sided with her husband,
and her feeding tube had been

16
00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:00,600
removed three days before.

17
00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:04,970
The federal courts
declined to step in.

18
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:09,320
She died on March the thirty-first,
thirteen days after the tube was

19
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,230
removed. She was forty-one.

20
00:01:14,170 --> 00:01:16,560
Most of us have never written
down what we'd want.

21
00:01:17,090 --> 00:01:21,370
In one large review, only about one
American adult in three had an

22
00:01:21,390 --> 00:01:22,440
advance directive.

23
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:29,060
So, when someone can't speak for
themselves, who should decide when

24
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:30,570
to stop keeping them alive?

25
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:32,870
Their husband or wife?

26
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:35,710
Their parents? A judge?

27
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:40,290
Politicians? And what should
count as their own words?
